{"type":"text","timestamp":1794527840985,"sessionID":"ses_e2dd11594ffe4d32Avi4cOny22","part":{"id":"prt_1d231bd6200215ipHhNoiJ391y","sessionID":"ses_e2dd11594ffe4d32Avi4cOny22","messageID":"msg_1d2319bb5001t00SbV1wovo10l","type":"text","text":"Done. T021 created one new test file and its verify command passes.\n\n**File written**\n`.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/command-brief-golden.vitest.ts`\n\nIt builds nine single-recommendation results and renders each through `renderAdvisorBrief`. Six are the golden heads from `plan.md` section 3 verbatim:\n\n- `sk-doc → /create:readme (start)`\n- `system-deep-loop → /deep:research (ask)`\n- `sk-design → /design:chart (start)`\n- `sk-git → /doctor:git hooks (ask)`\n- `system-spec-kit → /speckit:save (start)`\n- `sk-prompt → /prompt:improve (start)`\n\nEvery case asserts the head before `\\nDirectives:` with exact equality, then asserts the head is at most 320 characters and contains no `command-`. Three extra rows cover the matrix axes: `command-create-readme` with no command/policy/owner (filled from `COMMAND_ROWS`), `sk-review` with no row (plain skill head), and a command with an unknown id and no policy (parenthesis dropped).\n\n**Verify output**, run in `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime`:\n\n```\n RUN  v4.1.12 /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime\n\n Test Files  1 passed (1)\n      Tests  9 passed (9)\n   Start at  00:56:44\n   Duration  212ms (transform 105ms, setup 14ms, import 132ms, tests 5ms, environment 0ms)\n```\n\n**Not done**\nThe T021 checkbox in `tasks.md` is left unticked, as instructed. No other file was touched and no git state was changed. Nothing is blocked on the operator; the orchestrator's next step is to review this file and tick T021.","time":{"start":1794527837538,"end":1794527840985}}}
